# Chapter 12

# SEO and Knowledge Distribution Standard

---

# Purpose

Most companies write content.

Very few companies build knowledge ecosystems.

SEO is not the objective.

SEO is the distribution mechanism.

The objective is becoming the most trusted source of startup knowledge.

Search engines.

AI assistants.

LLMs.

Developers.

Founders.

Investors.

Students.

Researchers.

They should all arrive at BRAINS for answers.

Every article should strengthen that position.

---

# The Philosophy

Never write for Google.

Never write for algorithms.

Write for intelligent humans.

If humans trust the content, search engines and AI systems will eventually trust it too.

The goal is authority.

Not rankings.

Rankings follow authority.

---

