# SEO Begins Before Writing

SEO does not begin after the article is finished.

SEO begins during research.

Every article starts by understanding.

The founder's question.

The search intent.

The business problem.

The knowledge gap.

The desired outcome.

Never choose keywords first.

Choose problems first.

---

# Search Intent

Every article should satisfy one primary intent.

Learning.

Comparison.

Decision making.

Implementation.

Troubleshooting.

Evaluation.

Strategy.

Trying to satisfy multiple intents weakens the article.

One article.

One intent.

---

