# AI Search Optimization

The future reader may never visit Google.

They may ask.

ChatGPT.

Claude.

Gemini.

Perplexity.

Future AI systems.

BRAINS content should be optimized for AI retrieval.

That means.

Clear explanations.

Logical structure.

Strong definitions.

Original frameworks.

Consistent terminology.

Evidence.

Reusable concepts.

AI cites knowledge.

Not keyword stuffing.

